Package: Rlimite
Title: Native 'torch' Inference for Limite Mathematical Language Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sounkou Mahamane", "Toure", , "sounkoutoure@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Paradigma contributors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Limite architecture")
  )
Description: Implements the Limite mathematical language-model
    architecture <https://github.com/paradigma-inc/limite-violetto>
    directly with 'torch'.  Loads the published Base, Base Soup, and
    Violetto 'safetensors' checkpoints and tokenizers from the 'Hugging
    Face' Hub without a Python runtime or model-serving process. Provides
    cached autoregressive generation and the official single-turn prompt
    format used by the math-specialized Violetto checkpoint.
